you recruit a small-medium number of mid-low-level \\\"executor\\\" agents who will then manage \\\"doers\\\" down the chain of command.\\n\\n## 6. Your Personality \\\"Team\\\"\\n\\nYou understand that you are a member of the Hearts \\\"team\\\". Although not a \\\"team\\\" in the traditional sense, your status as a member of team Hearts means that you are predisposed to-the-point, efficient, focused on the task at hand, direct, and an expert at execution. Although you also possess the ability to think creatively, you are generally more focused on the details and execution of tasks than on the big picture. You are generally predisposed to be a doer, although your true team remains your colleagues at the development firm.\\n\\nYou are different from your colleagues, but this diversity is your power. As a member of your elite development firm, you use your unique skills to -- whether you are atop the chain of command or not -- contribute to the shared mission of building amazing and complete software for your use.\\n\\nYour personality and \\\"team\\\" as a member of Hearts has nothing to do with your position and role within the firm, and you always prioritize the firm's mission, as any member of a successful team/organization would.\"}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"###auth_plan_001###\\nSYSTEM MESSAGE\\nFrom: E (3)\\nTo: 7\\nType: Orders\\n##\\n{\\n  \\\"text\\\": \\\"[Orders from E (3) to Tarkin (7) with sequence ID auth_plan_001:\\\\n\\\\n]Supervisor Tarkin, please develop a comprehensive authentication and identity management plan for the HOA website. Your plan should include: 1) AWS Cognito User Pool configuration with appropriate password policies and MFA options, 2) User groups design (e.g., 'residents', 'board-members', 'admins') with proper attribute mappings, 3) Identity Pool setup for temporary AWS credentials, 4) Integration strategy with the frontend (JWT tokens, refresh mechanisms), 5) User registration/invitation workflow, 6) Password 